
Included is a new version (2.0) of FreeFile by Steve Bird of Test Drive BBS fame.

I've included this as it needed bugfixing (CTRL+Q doesn't work on remote) and needed cleaning
up a bit, although i've only spent 5 minutes on it (literally) and included purley for use
with Tag, to enable users to download the Amigaguide file.

As requested by Steve Bird the original docs have been included in the docs/ directory.

